## Changes Applied

### 1. logic_gate.py (Temporary Debug Configuration)
- Modified `__init__` defaults:
  - `high_confidence_threshold`: Changed from `0.85` → `1.01` (prevents early PASS)
  - `low_confidence_threshold`: Changed from `0.4` → `0.0` (prevents early FAIL/Noise exit)
  - Added note in docstring about temporary debug modification

### 2. recursive_flow.py (Debug Execution Logs)
